   $q$Text 1 includes magic, but Text 2 does not. What effect does this difference have?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Text 2 shows that the old warning still applies to ordinary choices in modern life.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Text 2 has a different lesson, since a phone cannot cause problems the way wind can.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Text 2 is less serious, since nobody in the story is affected by Ezra's choice at all.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Text 2 suggests that the old warning only mattered in times when people believed in magic.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-meaning"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Text 2 shows that the old warning still applies to ordinary choices in modern life.$q$, $q$Without magic, Ezra's trouble comes from his own app setting, which shows the same warning works in everyday life. His sister and mom are clearly affected, since they sent eleven messages and called twice.$q$, 'draft', 'ea3796cd-f7da-5600-9418-b6f0a7058cea')
